    "html": "<div class=\"c-cta-basic o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"c-cta-basic__inner o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-cta-basic__content\">\n<p class=\"\">Find answers to some of our most common questions</p>\n<a class=\"c-btn c-btn--outline cta-no-image\" href=\"/contact-us/frequently-asked-questions/\" id=\"cta\"><span>Read our FAQs</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "tag": "div",
    "classes": [
      "c-icon-block",
      "o-module",
      "c-ip-block--grey"
    ],
    "style": "",
    "html": "<div class=\"c-icon-block o-module c-ip-block--grey\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-overlay\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-wrap\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__content\" data-mobile-scroll-inner=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Call</h3>\n<p>To speak to our Supporter Care team, call <b>+44 (0)1444 446 600</b>. Open Mon to Sun, 8am-10pm</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Email</h3>\n<p>We’re happy to deal with general enquiries via email. Send your messages to <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#026b6c646d42716b656a767163746770712c6d7065\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"4a23242c250a39232d223e392b3c2f38396425382d\">[email protected]</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Post</h3>\n<p>Write to us at:<br/>\nBumpers Way, Bumpers Farm<br/>\nChippenham, SN14 6NG</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Social media</h3>\n<p>Connect with us to hear the latest news on <a class=\"pinklink\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sightsavers\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>, <a class=\"pinklink\" href=\"https://twitter.com/Sightsavers\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">X</a>, <a class=\"pinklink\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/sightsavers/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> and <a class=\"pinklink\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sightsavers/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Media enquiries</h3>\n<p>We have a dedicated press office that deals with enquiries from the media.<br/>\n<a href=\"/media-centre/\"> Visit our media centre</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-2 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">More information</h3>\n<p>For answers to some of the most common questions about Sightsavers, see our <a class=\"pinklink\" href=\"/contact-us/frequently-asked-questions/\">frequently asked questions</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "tag": "div",
    "classes": [
